# Time Tracker — AWS Deployment Architecture

> **Version**: 1.0 · **Date**: 27 Feb 2026 · **Audience**: DevOps / Infrastructure Engineer

---

## 1. Application Overview

| Layer | Technology | Details |
|-------|-----------|---------|
| **Mobile App** | Flutter 3.x (Dart SDK ^3.10.8) | Android & iOS, Riverpod state management |
| **Backend API** | Node.js + Express v5 | RESTful, ~60 endpoints, [server.js](file:///c:/Users/admin/Desktop/Time%20Tracker/backend/server.js) monolith |
| **Database** | SQLite3 (file-based) | 10+ tables, multi-tenant via `company` column |
| **File Storage** | Local `./uploads/` directory | Profile pictures, company logos |
| **Auth** | bcryptjs (password hashing) | No JWT — session via SharedPreferences |
| **Security** | Helmet, express-rate-limit, CORS | Rate limit: 100 req / 15 min window |

### Key Features
- Multi-tenant employee management (attendance, leaves, payroll, shifts)
- Geofence-based check-in/check-out with GPS validation
- Company-specific branding (logo + theme color)
- Push notifications (in-app), PDF payslip generation
- Biometric authentication (device-level via `local_auth`)

