## 5. CI/CD Pipeline

```mermaid
graph LR
    GH["GitHub<br/>Push to main"] --> CB["CodeBuild<br/>Build & Test"]
    CB --> ECR["ECR<br/>Push Image"]
    ECR --> CD["CodeDeploy /<br/>ECS Rolling Update"]
    CD --> ECS["ECS Fargate<br/>Blue-Green Deploy"]
```

| Stage | Tool | Action |
|-------|------|--------|
| **Source** | GitHub / CodeCommit | Trigger on push to [main](file:///c:/Users/admin/Desktop/Time%20Tracker/frontend/lib/main.dart#29-47) or `release/*` |
| **Build** | AWS CodeBuild | `npm ci`, `npm test`, `docker build`, push to ECR |
| **Deploy** | ECS Service Update | Rolling update (or blue-green via CodeDeploy) |
| **Mobile** | Local / Codemagic | `flutter build apk --release`, upload to Play Store |

**buildspec.yml** (CodeBuild):
```yaml
version: 0.2
phases:
  pre_build:
    commands:
      - echo Logging in to ECR...
      - aws ecr get-login-password --region $AWS_REGION | docker login --username AWS --password-stdin $ECR_URI
  build:
    commands:
      - docker build -t time-tracker-api .
      - docker tag time-tracker-api:latest $ECR_URI:$CODEBUILD_RESOLVED_SOURCE_VERSION
      - docker tag time-tracker-api:latest $ECR_URI:latest
  post_build:
    commands:
      - docker push $ECR_URI:$CODEBUILD_RESOLVED_SOURCE_VERSION
      - docker push $ECR_URI:latest
      - echo Writing image definition...
      - printf '[{"name":"api","imageUri":"%s"}]' $ECR_URI:latest > imagedefinitions.json
artifacts:
  files:
    - imagedefinitions.json
```

