## 6. Flutter App Configuration for Production

### API Base URL Management
Update [api_service.dart](file:///c:/Users/admin/Desktop/Time%20Tracker/frontend/lib/services/api_service.dart) to support environment switching:

```dart
class ApiService {
  // Production
  static const String baseUrl = 'https://api.timetracker.yourdomain.com/api';
  
  // Staging
  // static const String baseUrl = 'https://api-staging.timetracker.yourdomain.com/api';
}
```

### Build & Release
```bash
# Android APK
flutter build apk --release --build-name=1.0.1 --build-number=3

# Android App Bundle (Play Store)
flutter build appbundle --release

# iOS (requires macOS)
flutter build ipa --release
```

