## 7. Security Checklist

| # | Item | Status | Priority |
|---|------|--------|----------|
| 1 | Implement JWT authentication | ❌ Not done | 🔴 Critical |
| 2 | HTTPS everywhere (ACM + ALB) | ⬜ Pending | 🔴 Critical |
| 3 | Migrate SQLite → RDS PostgreSQL | ⬜ Pending | 🔴 Critical |
| 4 | Move uploads to S3 (private bucket) | ⬜ Pending | 🟡 High |
| 5 | Add API input validation (express-validator) | ❌ Not done | 🟡 High |
| 6 | Enable WAF on ALB | ⬜ Pending | 🟡 High |
| 7 | Implement RBAC middleware | ❌ Not done | 🟡 High |
| 8 | Database connection pooling | ⬜ Pending | 🟢 Medium |
| 9 | Enable CloudWatch logging | ⬜ Pending | 🟢 Medium |
| 10 | Setup backup & disaster recovery | ⬜ Pending | 🟢 Medium |

