## 8. Cost Estimation (Monthly)

### Minimal Setup (< 100 users)

| Service | Spec | Est. Cost |
|---------|------|-----------|
| EC2 (t3.micro) | 1 instance | ~$8.50 / mo (or Free Tier) |
| RDS PostgreSQL (t3.micro) | Single-AZ, 20 GB | ~$15 / mo (or Free Tier) |
| S3 | 5 GB storage | ~$0.12 / mo |
| ALB | 1 LB | ~$16 / mo |
| Route 53 | 1 hosted zone | ~$0.50 / mo |
| CloudWatch | Basic | Free Tier |
| **Total** | | **~$40 / mo** |

### Production Setup (100–1000 users)

| Service | Spec | Est. Cost |
|---------|------|-----------|
| ECS Fargate | 2 tasks (0.5 vCPU, 1 GB) | ~$30 / mo |
| RDS PostgreSQL (t3.small) | Multi-AZ, 50 GB | ~$50 / mo |
| S3 + CloudFront | 50 GB + CDN | ~$10 / mo |
| ALB | 1 LB | ~$16 / mo |
| Secrets Manager | 5 secrets | ~$2 / mo |
| CloudWatch | Enhanced | ~$10 / mo |
| **Total** | | **~$118 / mo** |

